      <Item ItemId=";ProjectJsonMigrateErrorMessage" ItemType="0" PsrId="211" Leaf="true">
        <Str Cat="Text">
          <Val><![CDATA[Project is not eligible for migration. Either the project is not packages.config based or doesn't support PackageReference yet. Visit https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/nuget/reference/migrate-packages-config-to-package-reference for more information.]]></Val>
          <Tgt Cat="Text" Stat="Loc" Orig="New">
            <Val><![CDATA[프로젝트가 마이그레이션에 적합하지 않습니다. 프로젝트가 packages.config 기반이 아니거나 아직 PackageReference를 지원하지 않습니다. 자세한 내용은 https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/nuget/reference/migrate-packages-config-to-package-reference를 방문하세요.]]></Val>
          </Tgt>
        </Str>
        <Disp Icon="Str" />
      </Item>
